      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140602_18055549_0442.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140602_18055549_0442&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140602_18055549_0442.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140602_18060422_0443.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140602_18060422_0443&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140602_18060422_0443.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;From: Clara, To: Grace Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Chicago, Illinois on July 11, 1910&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: Washington Park, Lagoon, Chicago. Oldest South Side Park; Area 371 Acres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Grace Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How are you? I sent you a letter some time ago. Guess you received it. Am in Chicago.&lt;br&gt;
Clara&lt;/p&gt;</description>
